<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN FIRST DIVISION SUMMARIES.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summaries of German Bundesliga matches played on Friday:</p>
<p>Werder Bremen 5 (Bode 17th minute, Herzog 32nd, Labbadia 38th, 56th, 67th) Bochum 1 (Hutwelker 85th). Halftime 3-0. Attendance 27,900</p>
<p>Fortuna Duesseldorf 0 Hansa Rostock 2 (Akpoborie 13th, Radwan 57th). 0-1. 12,000</p>
